Settings ▸ Storage and the Settings window (v1.0-2026.11.12) on macOS 11, past what codemod.py rewrites:
- A deletion asks in an alert with a destructive button: confirmationDialog is macOS 12.
- The info sheet closes through the presentation mode: the dismiss action is macOS 12.
- Each pane's hosting controller sets sizingOptions (macOS 13) only where it exists. On 11 it keeps no
  preferredContentSize, so a pane switch sizes the window to the pane's fitting size.

